        <activityName xml:lang="en">Welding, arc, aluminium</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Welding, arc, aluminium
Based on rather rough estimates. Not to be used if welding is of importance in the system considered.;
Synonyms: MAG; 
UUID: 7d8bbc64-b7e7-391d-9865-bf1bed4a04d3
Includes the arc welding of aluminium and the transports of the filler rod and the protective gas to the place of use. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: MIG Welding of aluminum with helium as protective gas.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7d8bbc64-b7e7-391d-9865-bf1bed4a04d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
